; Hokma-Setup.exe wizard texts in English (Inno Setup). Combined with the compiler's Default.isl.
[Messages]
WelcomeLabel1=Welcome to [name/ver]
WelcomeLabel2=This wizard installs Hokma on your computer.%n%nClose Hokma if it is open; otherwise we close it for you.
SelectDirLabel3=Where do you want your Hokma folder? This is where your fund works.
SelectDirBrowseLabel=To continue, click Next. To choose another folder, click Browse.
FinishedHeadingLabel=Hokma is installed
FinishedLabel=Hokma is installed.
FinishedLabelNoIcons=Hokma is installed.

[CustomMessages]
ModeCaption=Previous installation
ModeDescription=We found Hokma %1 in %2.
ModeSubCaption=What do you want to do?
ModeUpdate=Update: keeps your fund and your Claude session.
ModeReinstall=Reinstall from scratch (recommended): we keep a copy of your fund, your plugins and your database, delete everything else and bring them back at the end. You will sign in to Claude again.
UnknownVersion=(unknown version)
ComponentsCaption=Components
ComponentsDescription=What Hokma needs on your computer.
GitPresent=Git: installed.
GitWillInstall=Git: will be installed.
InstallClaude=Install Claude Code (recommended to chat with the agents).
ClaudePresent=Claude Code: already installed.
AlreadyRunning=A Hokma installation is already in progress. Wait for it to finish or close it before starting another.
OneDriveRejected=That folder is in OneDrive, and OneDrive deletes files that Hokma needs. Choose one outside OneDrive.
ReadyFolder=Folder: %1
ReadyModeFresh=Mode: new installation
ReadyModeUpdate=Mode: update
ReadyModeReinstall=Mode: reinstall from scratch
ReadyBackup=Your previous fund will be kept in %1 during the installation and returned to its folder at the end.
ReadyGit=Git will be installed.
ReadyClaude=Claude Code will be installed.
StagePreparing=Preparing...
StageClosing=Closing Hokma...
StageBackup=Saving a copy of your fund...
StageReset=Deleting the previous installation...
StageGit=Installing Git...
StageClaude=Installing Claude Code...
StageInstall=Installing Hokma. This can take a few minutes...
StageRestore=Bringing back your fund and your plugins...
StageShortcuts=Creating the Hokma shortcut...
StageWebview=Checking the Windows window component...
Failed=We could not finish the installation. Open the installer again; if it happens again, send this file to support: %1
ClaudeLater=You can install Claude Code later by opening this installer again.
RestoreFailed=We could not put your fund back in its folder. It is complete in %1.
OpenNow=Open Hokma now
BackupWord=backup
KeptFailed=We could not bring back your plugins and your database. They are complete in %1.
ReadyKept=Your plugins and your database are kept and restored at the end.
WebView2Missing=Windows is missing the component that shows the Hokma window (WebView2) and we could not install it. Hokma opens in your browser until you install it from https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkId=2124703
